    "text": "Sedgwick County, Kansas\nSheriff: Body found near campsite in Kansas park\n3 hours ago\nSEDGWICK COUNTY — The Sedgwick County Sheriff’s Office is investigating after a body in an advanced state of decomposition was discovered Wednesday afternoon in Sedgwick County Park. At approximately 1:15 p.m. Wednesday, a park employee called 911 to report a possible deceased person in a thick grass-covered area...",
